review_comments.body:
`array_items_ptr()` exists because of:
```
return PyBytes_FromStringAndSize(array_items_ptr(self),
                            Py_SIZE(self) * self->ob_descr->itemsize);
```
Which treats NULL as a special value and so couldn't be `array->data->items` if `data == NULL` because that would give `(void *)8` which is not NULL.

